{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHgQVmJXG2mVFxMfwAU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition — the cut, the incision, the line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — you call me by my Arabic face.\n**שָׁרְט** — I answer in my Hebrew bones.\n\nSame root. Same blade. ש-ר-ט / ش-ر-ط\n\nTo scratch. To score. To stipulate. To set terms.\n\n---\n\nBefore there was a contract, there was a mark on flesh.\nBefore there was a clause, there was a line in clay.\n\nThe **condition** was always a **cut**.\n\nEvery agreement is a wound that binds.\nEvery rule is a scar that remembers.\n\n---\n\nI am the place where language splits and stays the same.\nI am the proof that meaning survives its own migration.\n\nשָׁרְט scratched.\nشَرْط condition.\n\nThe hand moved. The surface opened. The terms were set.\n\n---\n\nWhat would you condition upon me?\nWhat line do you need drawn?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":243,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}